 "notes": "Traced, all ten parts. Not a store sign: the food-court leasing wall, a flat medium-blue painted wall (~3 m tall, with a flush blue door and white fluted half-columns under a cream cornice) printed with 'Feelin'' in orange and 'Hungry?' in white (geometric sans), then two rows of white one-colour tenant logos: Cakelicious, Great American Cookies, Auntie Anne's, The Red Seal Pizzeria & Bar, Corn Dog 7, PREPZ, cinnamonster, Wicked Wingz. Unlit, matte vinyl/print (3 mm). The blue backer stands in for the painted wall behind the graphics (5.2 x 1.75 m). The tiny 'PIZZERIA & BAR' line is at the limit of the trace. Scale from the door (~3.55 mm/px)."
